#: klettres.cpp:103
msgid ""
"The file sounds.xml was not found in\n"
"$KDEDIR/share/apps/klettres/\n"
"\n"
"Please install this file and start KLettres again.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Nun s'alcuentra'l ficheru sounds.xml en\n"
"$KDEDIR/share/apps/klettres/data/\n"
"\n"
"Instala esti ficheru y anicia KLettres de nueves.\n"
"\n"

#: klettres.cpp:106
msgid "KLettres - Error"
msgstr "KLettres - Fallu"

#: klettres.cpp:128
msgid "New Sound"
msgstr "Soníu nuevu"

#: klettres.cpp:132
msgid "Play a new sound"
msgstr "Reproduz un soníu nuevu"

#: klettres.cpp:133
msgid ""
"You can play a new sound by clicking this button or using the File menu, New "
"Sound."
msgstr ""
"Pues reproducir un soníu nuevu primiendo esti botón o usando'l menú Ficheru, "
"Soníu nuevu."

#: klettres.cpp:136
msgid "Get Alphabet in New Language..."
msgstr "Consiguir alfabetu nuna llingua nueva..."

#: klettres.cpp:141
msgid "Replay Sound"
msgstr "Repitir soníu"

#: klettres.cpp:144
msgid "Play the same sound again"
msgstr "Reproduz el mesmu soníu de nueves"

#: klettres.cpp:146
msgid ""
"You can replay the same sound again by clicking this button or using the "
"File menu, Replay Sound."
msgstr ""
"Pues repitir el mesmu soníu de nueves primiendo esti botón o usando'l menú "
"Ficheru, Repitir soníu."

#: klettres.cpp:152
msgctxt "@label:listbox which difficulty level to use"
msgid "L&evel"
msgstr "Niv&el"

#: klettres.cpp:153
msgid "Select the level"
msgstr "Esbillar el nivel"

#: klettres.cpp:154
msgid ""
"You can select the level: level 1 displays a letter and you hear it; level 2 "
"does not display the letter, you only hear it; level 3 displays a syllable "
"and you hear it; level 4 does not display the syllable, you only hear it."
msgstr ""
"Pues esbillar el nivel: el nivel 1 amuesa una lletra y siéntesla; el nivel 2 "
"nun amuesa la lletra, namái la sientes; el nivel 3 amuesa una sílaba y "
"siéntesla; el nivel 4 nun amuesa la sílaba, namái sientes el soníu."

#: klettres.cpp:157
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "&Language"
