msgstr "Esbilla'l tema"

#: klettres.cpp:172
msgid ""
"Here you can change the theme for KLettres. A theme consists in the "
"background picture and the font color for the letter displayed."
msgstr ""
"Equí pues camudar el tema pa KLettres. Un tema consiste nun semeya de fondu "
"y la color de la fonte pa la lletra amosada."

