#: main.cpp:35
msgid ""
"KLettres helps a very young child or an adult learning \n"
"a new language by associating sounds and \n"
"letters in this language.\n"
"\n"
"25 languages are available."
msgstr ""
"KLettres ayuda a neños pequeños o a adultos a \n"
"deprender una llingua nueva pola asociación de \n"
"soníos y lletres nesa llingua.\n"
"\n"
"Tán disponibles 25 llingües."

